    - target: {fileID: 2116517601969916342, guid: 183e809bca3827e41a67b7345a91f0c2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Magnavox Odyssey Light Rifle (above) and the NES Zapper (below)


        Many
        countries enforce laws on toy guns. For example, toy guns must be vibrant
        in colour, and the end of the barrel be bright orange. You can imagine just
        how long ago the Magnavox Odyssey released as it has a light gun resembling
        a real shotgun!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
